tended O-glycans in glycoproteins (PubMed:11677243). Plays a central role in many processes, such as angiogenesis, thrombopoiesis and kidney homeostasis development (By similarity)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}